"도에서 나온 건 며칠 전."

#: scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1db31b4c8d65de8fb4f76ec2ff62e9644b5fc6ec88b769c17d2d442fad183c19
#. default-sha256: d25c3aee663132cc38cd897dd6270a0bd1ade1719c7eccaf706d45c56a04656f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and I could still see it when I closed my eyes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the people lined up on the Grand-"
"Pont, awaiting entry, eager to start a new life there. Brimming with hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫눈을 감으니 생생히 떠오른다. ⟪k:1⟫그랑 퐁＜대교＞에는 ⟪k:2⟫수도로 이주하려는 사람들이 줄을 이"
"루었는데―― 모두 희망찬 표정을 짓고 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdf825594043e99e9a6a10eb1868de8dd53d177bf48935fbd23ac19a998091d0
#. default-sha256: e5ef78cfb18287dbb8442299cef6caf6668ffed4cc3d895f7f6aba5e8f73b77e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a city people were willing to pay high taxes to live in. ⟪k:1⟫If you were a "
"performer, you could get some of those costs shaved down a bit by putting those skills to use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫비싼 세금을 내서라도 들어가고 싶은 수도, ⟪k:1⟫표현자라면 몇 가지 재주를 선보여 면세받는다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38bdb3d758bf3384589a3653a98f1dcebeb6ad0405f3b369f7e1923f56f79631
#. default-sha256: 233384626971c877857ed704bfc66a299e894b8812e1c4bc8d1687fb6cff6a3d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The capital was harsh on those who wanted in, and apathetic about all who left."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫들어오는 인간에게는 엄격해도 나가는 인간은 ⟪k:1⟫거들떠보지 않는다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그게 수도다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8993bd0d56224e7240eb7b6a4a86924a7c214678601fde2ca5ef0755da7476b4
#. default-sha256: e4c702d26055c6ad49cd06e1cac0505e3919e91d8d4b45fcca08288496128256
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was composed of a powerful nobility and clergy,⟪k:1⟫wealthy merchants and bankers, and a "
"large population of poor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And it was the city I had called home for a long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫귀족, ⟪k:1⟫영광스러운 시민권을 얻은 서민, ⟪k:2⟫상인, ⟪k:3⟫인구 대다수를 차지하는 빈민으로 구"
"성된 도시. ⟪k:4⟫바로 ⟪k:5⟫그곳이 내가 ⟪k:6⟫오랜 시간 살아온 터전이었기에……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9ca2a685aef0e8a9c9dea4f6ba0cd55910201240aa92ca5ebb67171b67434e8
#. default-sha256: 54a66a23070608180d929f2d3359a274a369307f06d7e6fdbc571a5b7c2a65a1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know much about where I was heading."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지금부터 갈 곳이 어떤 곳인지는 ⟪k:1⟫자세히 알지 못 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3d6267442ac495866018bfedaf6a5d04c853b70b5c806f8469c0d0cb84e223c
#. default-sha256: 9e83c2e58946b866d5075fef37e460d5960b2f6f23e5ff6f7339c82d87495dfd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s getting foggy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Looks like it might rain..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫안개가…… 꼈네요. ⟪k:3⟫비가 내릴 것 같아요……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 342cf7237fbc596db10d03732dbedaba19c8c2a6ffd686b3e7f603147b7ed034
#. default-sha256: 6e448d3d9aa4afa2cea76e29f3f05636e6117f10934a3f9c7edbbdff566452d1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe we should take a little break.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You want to keep going? ⟪k:3⟫Oh... ⟪k:4⟫all "
"right, then."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫잠깐 쉬다 가지 않으실래요?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어머, ⟪k:3⟫좀 더 가시게요? ⟪k:4⟫네…… ⟪k:5⟫그러신가요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1827ab62c8675ffa7598876c9db3d9bfa507b588a4d91f9f299a2569168b528e
#. default-sha256: 8eaa10b2dcb0db7e82bfaad7ca17e8041034eb8e50d1e402111fd74a23b609fb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The coachman was frustratingly taciturn.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He acted as though he had gotten stuck "
"transporting a prisoner."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마부는 매우 과묵했다. ⟪k:1⟫꼭 죄인을 감옥으로 보내는 역할을 맡은 것처럼."

#: scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f3c5400ab0affb04636c533956b27243d8bb9a2193b67f5f5e1c1a372b588b8
#. default-sha256: 4bf0cfe074caa96935597665331e13df2a5488eb56699016448adf5b6371a1ee
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though that was hardly a stretch.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his point of view, I was nothing more than a "
"criminal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫실제로도 그게 맞겠다. ⟪k:1⟫마부 안에서 ⟪k:2⟫나는 죄인에 불과한 것이다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d02d16b6084606d34a80631bc4ece6c180cddd5338c4b25424e489613e374246
#. default-sha256: f47f006381db1f651efc5839494c463126b84b13231a68a87311ee36d57a9e0c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the times he ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ acknowledge I had said anything,⟪k:3⟫he made no effort to "
"hide the scorn in his eyes—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫말을 걸어서 ⟪k:1⟫가끔 내 쪽을 보게 해도, ⟪k:2⟫그 눈에는 ⟪k:3⟫노골적인 경멸과 모멸이 담겨 있었"
"다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4243ca265ac844d2801125df5d8d3d882b47eb35a2a71b275ed3c8797770998
#. default-sha256: 5a146014a1e65f8e6de22e21634d65eae582ad973bfc06b3d60286c5a59a78bd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I would just fall silent again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫싫은 역할을 맡았다―― 그런 기색이 역력한 태도. ⟪k:1⟫그런 태도에 ⟪k:2⟫나는 아무 말도 못 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 744f5990015751cb90efd564902d9f0d889d58feaa9c13a65913dff2b4f7d1a9
#. default-sha256: 9377d0ecc8d6cfc8c9042d3e41d75bb939a815767f6a711c9c6140323f842b82
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The road was gradually getting narrower. ⟪k:1⟫We had long since left the paved city roads "
"behind, and were now traveling along a couple worn-down grooves in the forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫길이 점점 좁아졌다. ⟪k:1⟫돌로 된 가도는 진작 끊겼다. ⟪k:2⟫지금 가는 길은 ⟪k:3⟫숲을 ⟪k:4⟫벌채"
"만 해 놓은 ⟪k:5⟫흙길이다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ef995db8d8147003b389a689bbbd74a175b843fa7c04c2736bd95af40cc664b
#. default-sha256: fc50a89f61c25d9e411bc33189c61ad3106d01bb37b72daa74dd4604cb1fd5df
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did I end up here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜 이렇게 된 건가――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b63e459cad8737c2a9a97bdf9cb453028b51b84da6920c560785ad902037452a
#. default-sha256: 9c2dae4fa9254b5f873b866fea88d8d7d4072b10524d30ab6f52a8c97f301211
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I being subjected to this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜 이런 처사를 당하는 건가――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f82ec9d2301705da5f440be461f54d190205726d80f6af10ac3133c9b810de35
#. default-sha256: 06f5cd45df9cb2002efe70825cba19995f63be748a057e2daf510b1bd190cdcf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was done thinking about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……이는 생각하길 ⟪k:1⟫그만두었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdc0b5374450c759bb9af93a070799377d0b434d3ec03b7b556673745d90a197
#. default-sha256: 9daf62a9b2f6bd834fd78d7226175f5578ad65877ce784723233222137d3bfb8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more I thought on it, the less fair it seemed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The more I remembered, the worse "
"it hurt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫생각할수록 부조리해서, ⟪k:1⟫떠올릴수록 고통만이 커졌기에."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bf98ed8e0ede5c0779669f0fb8e6e55e5b8e829a8472fd779eddafc1bdc5e51
#. default-sha256: 0ff5f38419b69ab72f65aa4f72d7e293e9253c2b1bd79f056bae91f9a906a3b7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I could do anymore was close my eyes and weather the storm."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그냥 ⟪k:1⟫눈을 감고…… 외면하는 수밖에 ⟪k:2⟫없었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a48e2b913ffa46f7371040750fc27f550d08b05ead51312bffb1ff2f24d28f6b
