"was so dark I couldn’t even tell where I was walking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫정문을 닫으니 ⟪k:13⟫한 치 앞"
"도 걷기 힘든 ⟪k:14⟫어둠에 잠식되었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_16AF63CF_68EA_4DDB_8B19_97AFC13E8226
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c954ee3988094578e6497264bf544ef0b268a1932df1a4124c9769cee02a7430
#. default-sha256: 1b76bc0b079bac44a2c19150c5bc19137dde628c78490b9a8735aa6b12d1b32a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_16AF63CF_68EA_4DDB_8B19_97AFC13E8226"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wonder... ⟪k:2⟫if the windows open."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫창문은…… 안 열리나……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_AA15CF14_500D_4B38_AF57_947AC84E078C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6f5d38e67f37f7d6e5f9c741f483a36ff46fc6a7ef7373bd68519c3a33d42fa
#. default-sha256: da784d15ebf57c8b82823cb68b356ff95c4535803af1056083bacf5da4a1cc3b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_AA15CF14_500D_4B38_AF57_947AC84E078C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though I managed to fumble my way over to a window, it was tightly shuttered, and the "
"shutters caked with rust.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was probably not getting it open without a fight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫더듬더듬 창가까지 가 봤지만, ⟪k:1⟫굳게 닫힌 덧문은 ⟪k:2⟫녹슬어 있어서 ⟪k:3⟫쉽게 열릴 것 같지 "
"않았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_708F7434_8D11_4346_B7E3_BC379E0CC7CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e93fd5c98bde8b6b9184703cfab8bb8933dbc25bfd4d34ba0ca61ad083c44cd8
#. default-sha256: 3c9232fca15e15dd9f5b285ec7ea7be630a5118d6fb0c4199bccb14688701476
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_708F7434_8D11_4346_B7E3_BC379E0CC7CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Darn... ⟪k:1⟫not a hint of light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아아, ⟪k:1⟫뭐야……. ⟪k:2⟫캄캄하네………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0839D5A2_76A3_4479_9250_FA63C9F2229C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7442304af537d8f7f638cf22a8833bf848cb39c77b9411b1acd9366b0fd94970
#. default-sha256: ce7ae25fb4d59cc7cdef6e295b52e49032b6331b130904ad98ce6480a18ee39e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0839D5A2_76A3_4479_9250_FA63C9F2229C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t even see my hand waving in front of my face.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It felt as though the floor "
"would fall out from under me and I would sink into eternal darkness if I didn’t watch my step."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 손가락도 안 보이는 어둠 속. ⟪k:1⟫방심하면 그대로 넘어져―― 어둠에 삼켜질 것만 같았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF3C5408_3F37_4E00_9647_CAEEE588D2F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59b145a1680b39d71cd86a4b803df30d19f5ac2553425f547defbf66e8f72b8e
#. default-sha256: e32e04da56e93a522c8bb11d67900352a5c91873aa7e7b438d48f85a468facd3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF3C5408_3F37_4E00_9647_CAEEE588D2F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fighting back that fear, I slowly walked forward, tracing the wall with my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 착각에 시달리면서 ⟪k:1⟫한 걸음씩 ⟪k:2⟫벽을 짚으며 천천히 걸었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F5D7FD38_6FA8_4927_8806_A282F02466B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fee0dc0170054f3382cfaeb917e78ff747928b70ad4ecd99e70f144c6e737da7
#. default-sha256: 5a7216bd9ea4e666511c69b00b785dc4f21e95d60f223b8d3011b5b5868c0219
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F5D7FD38_6FA8_4927_8806_A282F02466B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was a door at the end of a long corridor. I pulled it open, and a wisp of "
"bone-chilling air brushed past me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫긴 복도를 지나, ⟪k:3⟫복도 끝에 달린 문을 여니―― 뼛속부터 얼어붙을 것 같은 냉기가 "
"⟪k:4⟫내 뺨을 쓸고 갔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79f0211190d1c47bcb9cf4a830d34f0a968a9c0832317c913ddb270f2e80a17b
#. default-sha256: 984e925f48a060da3810445d3c2e055930de09d3e4144c400eeef5c68d4bae6f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was too dark to see anything, but I could feel something ⟪k:1⟫different⟪k:2⟫ present in "
"this area than the rest of the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무것도 없는 어둠이지만, ⟪k:1⟫이 공간에는 특수한 무언가가 존재하는 것만 같다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C7D8D1A_F976_4877_91A1_2CB164E9C884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a36794d44e15f5cd7d5c18f504309792e0a798c2a06fdf1c6b5a5f9319bbe253
#. default-sha256: a6569ddb3f9265c1d9e78594fa644b990c320ca642a340ca7338c40f742dc28a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C7D8D1A_F976_4877_91A1_2CB164E9C884"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Uneasiness gripped me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 기묘한 감각이 나를 사로잡았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F949FB49_0ED6_48BD_BA6D_AEC4B9AE13C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfb184603188f8dbcdce27a536eee4a74d8278348bcf98409679431ba636e6af
#. default-sha256: a56cb7ba197f97787b7b4708f631798a0778fda10990e03ea8f6d404a9e32aa7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F949FB49_0ED6_48BD_BA6D_AEC4B9AE13C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hello...? ⟪k:1⟫Is anyone there?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Please don’t tell me it’s actually abandoned."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저기…… 누구 ⟪k:1⟫안 계세요? ⟪k:2⟫역시…… 빈 집인가?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0EB93F4A_791E_468A_8BB1_D407C05C9F9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4260d01309a9875d002d7f2db970cb3b2338e02a0eb8d25d5c8e832e273bd24b
#. default-sha256: 564dddf38642363ab7b027e7e05491116ff1b1d7edd8f0dca1c1536325dc7f70
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0EB93F4A_791E_468A_8BB1_D407C05C9F9F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫........................"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……………………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8ED803C1_49A5_4072_B478_EAD5F86D0606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6217d0ccd91a81996992d4487f0086f27ea066f4a329b66e64fb7634d1aa0309
#. default-sha256: d14649023c48981eff3c376bb52dc62c6f67d2bec9e377cf46a1606adc1e227f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8ED803C1_49A5_4072_B478_EAD5F86D0606"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suppose I can’t know without looking around a bit more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……조금 더 ⟪k:1⟫찾아봐야 알겠지……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7459A744_504E_4A22_B2AB_FE1F3D665720
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19e0913b2811e1de18487b31a0b740c4e80ce01b500c5af6f4fdfb74c27fb766
#. default-sha256: e661d0d3217d829b7ea84bee619c61ff59dbd7ac196c28dd681501e71209ceef
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7459A744_504E_4A22_B2AB_FE1F3D665720"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My voice simply disappeared into the void.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No response."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 목소리가 ⟪k:1⟫어둠 속으로 빨려 들어갔다. ⟪k:2⟫대답은 없었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B7FE4138_5A74_4965_A6EE_B0030387B0F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 266b68d577e2ea115f5b7037bac28c25331692dcf648f193785bcb664264c1f9
#. default-sha256: 26b5a12cdc2c39428b7d4991dc5bcca6355e7821e6c7e685f1c3b69985bc44c6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B7FE4138_5A74_4965_A6EE_B0030387B0F5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I pushed forward through the freezing air,⟪k:1⟫for a split second, I spotted a shimmer of "
"light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫냉랭하고도 기이한 공간을 더 나아가니―― ⟪k:1⟫아주 잠깐 빛이 일렁였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0BC2FFE7_19E0_44DB_8429_50B92FACAC3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fda5f4493a3c40687f7ed5ed8c8d7098961d5d8f3aab23cadf5fdf25bd7e134b
#. default-sha256: c688bc561fca1fe7493a49f62b9f1f2b2abfc53f4621a4a88981b75297235c46
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0BC2FFE7_19E0_44DB_8429_50B92FACAC3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Squinting my eyes, I was able to make out a large window.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Unlike the others, it "
"wasn’t shuttered."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫주의 깊게 관찰하고서야 ⟪k:1⟫거기에 커다란 창문이 있단 걸 깨달았다. ⟪k:2⟫다른 창문처럼 덧문으"
"로 잠기지 않았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2DA6D4A5_42A2_4C27_B961_7871B7674FAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1011de01f1a7fa4c70d4ed46057f759beef5059aacbf88924cb1a32a77431db1
#. default-sha256: 428da7660041531a3861668592ca57f9e071cb1c88f2680001a8be750e52ccef
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2DA6D4A5_42A2_4C27_B961_7871B7674FAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do we have here?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Drapes? ⟪k:3⟫I see a little light beyond—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……이건…… ⟪k:1⟫뭐지. ⟪k:2⟫암막……? ⟪k:3⟫안에서 빛이―――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_562B7D5B_F18A_40F6_863E_CF87BDFCCC01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db064488e8798cfdfd61ba9f319a40b242bd1a823b64ef0c0ff9ed4cb16fa16c
#. default-sha256: 77de39bf5e222c174a28e5c196dd2ab44e2c8b565045d3ffe58d4f1df16419f2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_562B7D5B_F18A_40F6_863E_CF87BDFCCC01"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My chances were slim, I imagined, but if there was even a ⟪k:1⟫slight⟪k:2⟫ possibility of "
"getting some light in here, it was worth a shot. ⟪k:3⟫So I pulled open the drapes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫가능성은 낮아 보였다. ⟪k:1⟫하지만 ⟪k:2⟫조금이나마 빛이 들어오길―― 바라며 ⟪k:3⟫검은 암막을 들"
"추었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_ADD5F002_4B0A_4E4D_B870_E80A7FC9BC68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50059d0e4a7994006889d5c90276919134b5784cabef3915cbe6f82dd5458d3c
#. default-sha256: 1c378ce91d742daafb867a52eef13b4302e6befacb8e75fe5235b1c4e491a96a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_ADD5F002_4B0A_4E4D_B870_E80A7FC9BC68"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4E3426A4_DA8C_4B61_8938_33DCD9A3A1DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a569410d5458c797f7e62cadfec2c09576303063fd0f079131e998bee49ea7aa
#. default-sha256: ee344b63e1c78d94cb7a59bd3b1f4fcc7bd703d63f11827716513ab1a49e3e2f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4E3426A4_DA8C_4B61_8938_33DCD9A3A1DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The next moment, faint but "
"colorful light shone down on me.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫It was a stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫그 순간, ⟪k:13⟫형형색색 빛깔"
"이 ⟪k:14⟫나를 은은히 비추었다. ⟪k:15⟫암막에 가려진 건…… 스테인드 글라스였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF0DBDF1_4A42_4E67_B2E9_56CF1C9D6DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 164ab43a7f19142ff207fea8d82040ef820b9947cc4cd06e3d6f775c55d9a622
#. default-sha256: 8a518ab1f601f504290c0e47c873e90eab3f88fa8defa3065f10c5539d73c2ce
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF0DBDF1_4A42_4E67_B2E9_56CF1C9D6DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From beyond the glass, I could hear the subtle pitter-patter of rain.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It had "
"finally started, it seemed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫스테인드 글라스 너머에선 ⟪k:1⟫기어코 내리기 시작했는지, ⟪k:2⟫희미한 빗소리가 들렸다. ⟪k:3⟫나"
"를 감싸는 유백색 빛."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0BD7E9ED_3AC8_4F98_BC9B_8E4A52FE7EE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bb6d9d827e76b8d14e82e52bc494576ed4db27fc12c476658ed04b40e051894
#. default-sha256: 83fea7e2a44818beab3aea8e184272541e78574f3e255325a40ecf55b3868062
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0BD7E9ED_3AC8_4F98_BC9B_8E4A52FE7EE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The different colors of light blended into a milky white—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫dim but wondrous."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 희미했으나, ⟪k:1⟫몹시…… 따사로웠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_177D9B11_1F96_4635_A010_1193C3615D29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b33d5ec415a318adab367c179949f9d9df9ccfead8a9a8a5995a4dd0f0863f35
#. default-sha256: 7c58f50222996881b561d4122ffa74c9db495977f63d4d45284b0725f8650930
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_177D9B11_1F96_4635_A010_1193C3615D29"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It’s so pretty...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It looks like an angel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이건…… ⟪k:1⟫스테인드 글라스네. ⟪k:2⟫천사님인가? ⟪k:3⟫예쁘다………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7C82706_D850_4DDC_AF6D_96B537A46A2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a1ade0416f8cb59cde276fe6aabe6414912a132d31fcfae5e9691dd899dccb5
#. default-sha256: a3d42d2126885c9a70d3ba4ef516f3717fa3765f2c48f7d6f29c123a1c2a0caa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7C82706_D850_4DDC_AF6D_96B537A46A2A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why would someone cover this up? It’s beautiful.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫With a little more light, it’d be—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하아, ⟪k:1⟫왜 이렇게 예쁜 걸 ⟪k:2⟫숨겨 놓는 거람. ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫빛이 더 들어오면 ⟪k:5⟫아름답게――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9485AF68_781D_418F_B49F_D30C7DAB73A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80ce98e18a870de3b50143d68c1943c9a8d68c7dc1b81103998ebb01c91146cd
